{ This chapter is for people who hate playing against those people who bring their queen out super early. Play your English. }
1. c4 d5 { This is the Anglo-Scandinavian. If you don't want nothin' to do with it, play d4. } 2. d4 { Perfect! This is now a Queen's Gambit. 99% of Anglo-Scandinavian players expect you to take the pawn, but now, they're out of their territory. } *

